- **Why:** `is_valid_strategy(cuts, n, prices)` requires every `cuts[i] > 0` and `sum_lengths(cuts) == n`. A sum of positive integers is never negative, so for `n < 0` no valid strategy exists. The "Existence" postcondition (`exists cuts :: is_valid_strategy(cuts, n, prices) && ...`) is then false.
